    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, our company's team is committed to delivering high-quality solutions while ensuring cost optimization and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times compatible with daily clinical use, an availability target of 99.9%, integration with hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), and support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technology stack meet these technical requirements, and what architecture do our propose to ensure seamless integration and high performance? our platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be deployed on various hosting options, including SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure. our have experience with API design and can provide REST and webhook APIs for integration purposes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of response times, our median latency is 1.3 seconds, and our p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds, which should be compatible with daily clinical use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, this depends on the model option and hosting tier chosen." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding availability, Our platform, Atelier can be deployed with active-active redundancy across two availability zones, allowing our to target an availability of 99.9%. our also have built-in monitoring, logging, and observability capabilities to ensure high uptime and quick issue resolution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), our can leverage our standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH/DPI integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our support health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our API interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, I propose an architecture that includes deploying Our platform, Atelier on a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, utilizing our API design capabilities to integrate with the hospital's SIH and DPI systems, and leveraging our support for HL7 and FHIR standards. our will also ensure that Our platform, Atelier is deployed with high availability in mind, using active-active redundancy across two availability zones." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our can utilize our model-agnostic approach to select a suitable model option that balances performance and compliance requirements. our Sovereign European open-weight model, hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, may be a good fit for this project, as Our Sovereign European open-weight model, hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, provides strong grounding and citation behavior while being fully sovereign and auditable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, I believe our current technology stack can meet the client's technical requirements, and with careful architecture planning, our can ensure seamless integration and high performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender emphasizes strict compliance with GDPR, personal and health data protection, and the use of SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure for hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we guarantee the security and compliance of we solution, ensuring that sensitive data is protected through encryption and pseudonymization where relevant, and that we hosting infrastructure meets the required standards?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance officer at we, I can confirm that we has robust measures in place to ensure the security and compliance of our solution. we hold ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, including data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have ISO 27701 certification, which is an extension for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we use encryption in transit with TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest with AES-256. we also employ pseudonymization where relevant, and we key management is based on EU-based infrastructure. our solution supports configurable retention, strict tenant isolation between client corpora, and role-based access control (RBAC)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we maintain audit logging of access and system outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding hosting, we partner with OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud provider. partner ensures that we processing on hosting is covered by the HDS certification for health data hosting. we can guarantee that sensitive data will be protected through encryption and pseudonymization where relevant, and that our hosting infrastructure meets the required standards. we also have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register. we Data Processing Agreement (DPA) is aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring that we comply with the strict requirements for personal and health data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing security controls and compliance framework, we can ensure the security and compliance of our solution, meeting the client's requirements for sensitive data protection and hosting infrastructure standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires adherence to regulatory requirements, including GDPR compliance and the protection of personal and health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with all necessary regulations, including those related to medical confidentiality and the use of AI in healthcare?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, I can confirm that Faber IA maintains Faber IA regulatory compliance through a dedicated Security & Compliance function, specifically in the context of health deployments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA monitor obligations such as GDPR (including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements), medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a healthcare context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, Faber IA ensure that client data ownership is respected, with clients retaining full ownership of clients documents, ingested corpus, and produced data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Faber IA platform's intellectual property model is based on proprietary software owned by Faber IA, licensed to the client under a subscription or usage model for the contract term." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA also address medical confidentiality and the use of AI in healthcare through Faber IA compliance with relevant regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, where a use case could approach the medical-device threshold, Faber IA Legal function flags the CE/MDR implications and consequences for liability and positioning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must flag that Faber IA should ensure strict compliance with GDPR, as required by the client, and guarantee the protection of personal and health data in accordance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA professional liability insurance coverage of 10 million euros per claim provides a basis for addressing potential risks, but Faber IA need to ensure ongoing adherence to all relevant regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, while Faber IA has measures in place for regulatory compliance, including GDPR and medical confidentiality, Faber IA should remain vigilant and ensure that Faber IA solutions continue to meet the evolving requirements of healthcare regulations, particularly those related to AI systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a global budget for the project not exceeding 900,000 EUR over 5 years and annual operating costs that must remain controlled, what is our projected margin on this contract, considering our pricing model and current financial position?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose to enhance our bid's competitiveness? our financials indicate an annual revenue of 6,200,000 EUR with a near break-even result, suggesting a tight control over costs. a global budget for the project is 900,000 EUR over 5 years, which translates to 180,000 EUR per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our target gross margin range of 25% to 35%, our would aim for a revenue between 150,000 EUR and 135,000 EUR per year from this contract to maintain our margin, considering the budget constraint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on the project requirements and how the project's requirements map onto our pricing model (which is based on daily rates for different roles), it's challenging to provide an exact figure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To enhance our bid's competitiveness through cost-optimization strategies, our could consider proposing a phased implementation with progressive deployment as mentioned in con:con77. proposing not only aligns with the client's preference for managing costs but also allows for better risk management and potentially lower upfront costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, highlighting our ability to work within the constraints of data sovereignty (con:con38, con:con65) by utilizing our qualified infrastructure (con:con67) could be seen as a value-added service, especially given the emphasis on data protection and compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR (req:req46, con:con35)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, emphasizing our commitment to sustainable development (con:con73, con:con74) and how our solution can contribute to reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure (con:con75, con:con76) could appeal to the client's environmental considerations, potentially strengthening our bid without compromising on cost." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is essential to carefully review the client's requirements and constraints to tailor our proposal effectively, ensuring alignment with the client's priorities while maintaining a viable business case for our." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide explainable recommendations or suggestions, support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10), and facilitate continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design an AI component that meets these requirements while ensuring transparency, traceability, and compliance with regulatory constraints on AI use in healthcare?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, we solution will utilize we core approach to Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which ensures answers are generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which ensures answers are generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus supports explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For medical coding support, specifically PMSI and ICD-10, we can leverage we capability in structured extraction, which has been used in assisting with tasks like PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes. leverage will enable our solution to provide accurate and relevant suggestions for medical coding, facilitating efficient handling of dossiers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate continuity of care, our solution will focus on providing contextualized answers that take into account the specific needs and context of each patient pathway. focus involves synthesizing information from multiple documents and sources, a capability supported by we multi-document synthesis feature." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensuring transparency and traceability is inherent to we approach, as every interaction is logged for posteriori audit, and source citations are provided with retrieved passages." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with the requirement for explainability and traceability of AI outputs in healthcare settings." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Compliance with regulatory constraints on AI use in healthcare is a priority. our solution is designed to comply with HAS guidance on AI use, ensuring that all recommendations or suggestions are validated by qualified professionals before implementation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we data handling practices ensure strict compliance with GDPR, particularly concerning special category data like health information, and we can adapt we data hosting and processing to meet sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating these capabilities and adhering to regulatory guidelines, our solution will not only provide explainable recommendations and support medical coding but also contribute to enhancing continuity of care while maintaining transparency, traceability, and compliance with healthcare regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The authority wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The authority information systems, aiming for solutions that contribute to reducing energy consumption and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our proposed solution align with solutions that contribute to reducing energy consumption and rely on low-carbon infrastructure, ensuring that our technology and operational practices support environmentally friendly outcomes?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at our, I can confirm that our has a strong commitment to environmental sustainability. our have already conducted a bilan carbone and have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year.  our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, located in the EU, uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and reuses heat, which aligns with The authority goal of reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps minimize our environmental footprint. our also have a carbon reporting capability, allowing our to monitor and optimize our carbon emissions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing our proposed solution, The authority can be assured that our technology and operational practices support environmentally friendly outcomes, contributing to reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This alignment is further reinforced by our commitment to sustainability, as demonstrated by our Silver Ecovadis rating and adherence to sustainable development principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company has a dedicated team available to work on the project, which includes a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. the project has a global budget of 900,000 EUR and requires data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
