    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Evaluation criteria Offers will be evaluated against the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution; compliance with regulatory requirements; level of security; data sovereignty; quality of integration with the existing SIH/DPI; total cost of the proposed solution; consideration of environmental issues; capacity for innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the project's global budget of 900,000 EUR over 5 years and the requirement for controlled annual operating costs, what is our company's current capacity to deliver a solution that meets the client's needs while ensuring cost optimization and compliance with regulatory requirements? our company's, has a dedicated team available to work on the project's, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. our company's also have additional resources for change management and training." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirements and constraints, our company's can deliver our company's flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents. our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents aligns with the client's need for data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements. our company's have experience working in the healthcare sector, having previously worked with a regional hospital group on a pilot assistant for medical documentation integrated with a regional hospital group electronic patient record. our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents can assist hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, provide access to reliable and up-to-date information, and support drafting of clinical and administrative content." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of cost optimization, our company's available capacity includes a dedicated team that can work efficiently to deliver the project's within the budget constraints. our company's also have experience working with public-sector procurement frameworks, which will help our company's navigate the regulatory requirements and ensure compliance." ;
